{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"La Navidad en sus manos","Unos días antes de la Navidad, Papá Noel (Santiago Segura) tiene un accidente de trineo en pleno centro de Madrid y acaba en el hospital. Por suerte, Salva (Ernesto Sevilla), su compañero de habitación, puede sustituirle en su sagrada labor navideña. Aunque es un buscavidas más acostumbrado a vender piezas de coche robadas que a repartir regalos. Para Salva la única manera de recuperar a su familia es aceptar tan entrañable misión. La cuenta atrás para la llegada de la Nochebuena avanza inexorable y aun deberá encontrar a los renos de Papá Noel, aprender a volar en trineo y lo que es más difícil aun: aprender a ser una buena persona.",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"festivities","self-employment","physical illness","supernatural entity","disability","hospital","medical treatment","gray face","technology",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":19,"filmType":23,"directors":24,"genre":33,"media":37,"synopsis":40,"production":41,"characters":44,"roles":79,"awards":95,"tags":3},"Film","ES2023_006","es2023-006-la-navidad-en-sus-manos",{"native":1,"english":18},"",{"type":20,"date":21,"year":22},"Theatrical release","2023-12-01",2023,"Fiction film",[25],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":32},"Joaquín Mazón","joaquin-mazon",1976,0,"Male identifying","Spain",[],[34,35,36],"Comedy","Children's Film","Fantasy",{"posterUrl":38,"trailerUrl":39},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt23037846/mediaviewer/rm3673642497/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.filmaffinity.com/es/evideos.php?movie_id=349755",{"native":2,"english":18},[42],{"country":31,"share":43},"Majority coproducer",[45,59,71],{"id":46,"film":15,"person":47,"age":52,"gender":30,"sexuality":53,"origin":54,"class":55,"profession":56,"ability":57,"assistedMobility":58},"ES2023_006_01",{"id":48,"slug":49,"name":48,"birthYear":50,"deathYear":29,"gender":30